      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TO THE STARS (6) comes off an average effort last start when eighth at this track over 320m behind Beef Kebab (19.22) in a Grade 5. Was a winner the start prior. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. ADAMANT ANDY (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (18.64) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Worth another chance. CREEPING CLOVER (8) showed good speed to score (18.53) off a middle draw two back then off a similar box last time settled off pace and could manage only a 9 length 6th at this track (18.99). Some good form is emerging from her last run. Has the ability to give this a shake. JUNGLE GYM (1) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
